msgctxt "100"
msgid "Hello?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "Kiryu? It's me. How'd things go with old baldy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"I found him. He was horrible all right, but he's pretty\r\n"
"small time. I don't think he has the wit to outsmart\r\n"
"Kashiwagi-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "Dammit. And here I thought we had a lead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"Guess we weren't as close as we thought. Anyway, I'll fill\r\n"
"you in when I get back. You over at Serena?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"Yup, Mama said we can use it whenever we want. Just meet me\r\n"
"over here, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Sure, see you soon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Try not to get too distracted on your way here."
msgstr ""

